<title>USA: Dames &amp; Moore to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Dames &amp; Moore to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dames &amp; Moore Group has agreed in principle with Hochtief Aktiengesellschaft vorm. Gebr. Helfmann (Hochtief AG) to effectively repurchase all 3,700,000 shares of Dames &amp; Moore stock held by the German civil engineering and construction company.</p>
<p>The agreement is subject to certain approvals and the satisfaction of certain contingencies. The company plans to use the acquired shares to facilitate acquisitions or may remarket them if market conditions permit.</p>
</text>
